div.p:
Thus, more than two years passed away; unforeseen obstacles presented themselves;
                    the courage of our soldiers triumphed over everything, and the flag of France
                    floated in triumph over the city of Mexico.

To-morrow, therefore, the order will be: Continuation of the discussion on the
                    deficiency budget for 1865; discussion of the bill relative to liquidation;
                    discussion of the budget for 1866; discussion of bills of local interest.
